{"page":133,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:45","surah":6,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"فَقُطِعَ دَابِرُ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ ۚ وَٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ رَبِّ ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The evildoers were wiped out: praise be to God, the Lord of the Worlds!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَقُطِعَ","en_gloss":"So was cut off","transliteration":"faquṭiʿa","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"دَابِرُ","en_gloss":"(the) remnant","transliteration":"dābiru","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"(of) the people","transliteration":"l-qawmi","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"[those] who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ظَلَمُوا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"did wrong","transliteration":"ẓalamū","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"And all praises and thanks","transliteration":"wal-ḥamdu","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(be) to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَبِّ","en_gloss":"Lord","transliteration":"rabbi","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the worlds","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","verse_key":"6:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:45"}]},{"verse_key":"6:46","surah":6,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَرَءَيْتُمْ إِنْ أَخَذَ ٱللَّهُ سَمْعَكُمْ وَأَبْصَـٰرَكُمْ وَخَتَمَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِكُم مَّنْ إِلَـٰهٌ غَيْرُ ٱللَّهِ يَأْتِيكُم بِهِ ۗ ٱنظُرْ كَيْفَ نُصَرِّفُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ ثُمَّ هُمْ يَصْدِفُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘Think: if God were to take away your hearing and your sight and seal up your hearts, what god other than He could restore them?’ See how We explain Our revelations in various ways, yet still they turn away.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"6:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","en_gloss":"Have you seen","transliteration":"ara-aytum","verse_key":"6:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِن