":"(46)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:46"}]},{"verse_key":"6:47","surah":6,"ayah":47,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَرَءَيْتَكُمْ إِنْ أَتَىٰكُمْ عَذَابُ ٱللَّهِ بَغْتَةً أَوْ جَهْرَةً هَلْ يُهْلَكُ إِلَّا ٱلْقَوْمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Think: if the punishment of God should come to you, by surprise or openly, would anyone but the evildoers be destroyed?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَكُمْ","en_gloss":"Have you seen","transliteration":"ara-aytakum","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَتَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"comes to you","transliteration":"atākum","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَذَابُ","en_gloss":"punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābu","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَغْتَةً","en_gloss":"suddenly","transliteration":"baghtatan","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَهْرَةً","en_gloss":"openly","transliteration":"jahratan","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هَلْ","en_gloss":"will","transliteration":"hal","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُهْلَكُ","en_gloss":"(any) be destroyed","transliteration":"yuh'laku","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمُ","en_gloss":"the people ","transliteration":"l-qawmu","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","verse_key":"6:47"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٤٧","en_gloss":"(47)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:47"}]},{"verse_key":"6:48","surah":6,"ayah":48,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا نُرْسِلُ ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ إِلَّا مُبَشِّرِينَ وَمُنذِرِينَ ۖ فَمَنْ ءَامَنَ وَأَصْلَحَ فَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We send messengers only to give good news and to warn, so for those who believe and do good deeds there will be no fear, nor will they grieve.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نُرْسِلُ","en_gloss":"We send","transliteration":"nur'silu","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","en_gloss":"the Messengers","transliteration":"l-mur'salīna","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مُبَشِّرِينَ","en_gloss":"(as) bearer of glad tidings","transliteration":"mubashirīna","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمُنذِرِينَ ۖ","en_gloss":"and (as) warners","transliteration":"wamundhirīna","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَمَنْ","en_gloss":"So whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ءَامَنَ","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmana","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَصْلَحَ","en_gloss":"and reformed","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥa","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خَوْفٌ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"khawfun","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَحْزَنُونَ","en_gloss":"will grieve","transliteration":"yaḥzanūna","verse_key":"6:48"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤٨","en_gloss":"(48)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:48"}]},{"verse_key":"6:49","surah":6,"ayah":49,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا يَمَسُّهُمُ ٱلْعَذَابُ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَفْسُقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As for those who rejected Our signs, torment will afflict them as a result of their defiance.","words":[{"po