ou give thought","transliteration":"tatafakkarūna","verse_key":"6:50"},{"pos":29,"ar":"٥٠","en_gloss":"(50)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:50"}]},{"verse_key":"6:51","surah":6,"ayah":51,"ar_uthmani":"وَأَنذِرْ بِهِ ٱلَّذِينَ يَخَافُونَ أَن يُحْشَرُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِمْ ۙ لَيْسَ لَهُم مِّن دُونِهِۦ وَلِىٌّ وَلَا شَفِيعٌ لَّعَلَّهُمْ يَتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Use the Quran to warn those who fear being gathered before their Lord- they will have no one but Him to protect them and no one to intercede- so that they may beware.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَأَنذِرْ","en_gloss":"And warn","transliteration":"wa-andhir","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِهِ","en_gloss":"with it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَخَافُونَ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"yakhāfūna","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُحْشَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they will be gathered","transliteration":"yuḥ'sharū","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ ۙ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَيْسَ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":12,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","en_gloss":"other than Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلِىٌّۭ","en_gloss":"any protector","transliteration":"waliyyun","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":15,"ar":"شَفِيعٌۭ","en_gloss":"any intercessor","transliteration":"shafīʿun","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَّعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"(become) righteous","transliteration":"yattaqūna","verse_key":"6:51"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٥١","en_gloss":"(51)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:51"}]},{"verse_key":"6:52","surah":6,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَطْرُدِ ٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ رَبَّهُم بِٱلْغَدَوٰةِ وَٱلْعَشِىِّ يُرِيدُونَ وَجْهَهُۥ ۖ مَا عَلَيْكَ مِنْ حِسَابِهِم مِّن شَىْءٍ وَمَا مِنْ حِسَابِكَ عَلَيْهِم مِّن شَىْءٍ فَتَطْرُدَهُمْ فَتَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do not drive away those who call upon their Lord morning and evening, seeking nothing but His Face. You are in no way accountable for them, nor they for you; if you drove the believers away, you would become one of the evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَطْرُدِ","en_gloss":"send away","transliteration":"taṭrudi","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"call","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَبَّهُم","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbahum","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْغَدَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"in the morning","transliteration":"bil-ghadati","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلْعَشِىِّ","en_gloss":"and the evening","transliteration":"wal-ʿashiyi","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُرِيدُونَ","en_gloss":"desiring","transliteration":"yurīdūna","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَجْهَهُۥ ۖ","en_gloss":"His Countenance","transliteration":"wajhahu","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"(is) on you","transliteration":"ʿalayka","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:52"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ح